  "title": "Rivalry And Brotherhood - The Army Navy Game",
  "description": "The ultimate battle of good versus good: Cadets from the United States\r\nMilitary Academy and Midshipmen from the United States Naval Academy battle\r\nit out on the football field during \"America's Game.\" Among the roar of the crowd, the rumble of drums, and the clashing of helmets, these players play\r\nfor more than the love of the game; they play for patriotism, for honor, for\r\ntheir communities, and for their country. After this game, they'll face new\r\nadversaries together as one joint force fighting for the same cause. Produced by\r\nSean K. Harp. Lead Editor/Colorist -\r\nPhilip L. Diab. Assistant Editor/Audio Engineer - Matthew N. Friere. Camera Operators - Sean K. Harp, Matthew N. Freire, Gabriel J. Segura, Philip L. Diab\r\nCodie M. Mendenhall. Narrator \r\nGabriel J. Segura.",
